{"id":4379,"date":"2025-06-24T07:13:55","date_gmt":"2025-06-24T07:13:55","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/?p=4379"},"modified":"2025-08-11T04:11:14","modified_gmt":"2025-08-11T04:11:14","slug":"dich-vu-van-hanh-shopee-chuyen-nghiep","status":"publish","type":"post","link":"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/tin-tuc\/dich-vu-van-hanh-shopee-chuyen-nghiep\/","title":{"rendered":"D\u1ecbch v\u1ee5 v\u1eadn h\u00e0nh Shopee chuy\u00ean nghi\u1ec7p, t\u1ed1i \u01b0u v\u1eadn h\u00e0nh"},"content":{"rendered":"<div data-page-id=\"DfJPdzwOnoX0LYxAMr7lZUydgIp\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-ImhMd3uzloX6H8xUuEfllEVZg6f\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">D\u1ecbch v\u1ee5 v\u1eadn h\u00e0nh Shopee l\u00e0 gi\u1ea3i ph\u00e1p tr\u1ecdn g\u00f3i gi\u00fap c\u00e1c nh\u00e0 b\u00e1n h\u00e0ng t\u1ed1i \u01b0u h\u00f3a ho\u1ea1t \u0111\u1ed9ng kinh doanh tr\u00ean s\u00e0n th\u01b0\u01a1ng m\u1ea1i \u0111i\u1ec7n t\u1eed m\u1ed9t c\u00e1ch chuy\u00ean nghi\u1ec7p v\u00e0 hi\u1ec7u qu\u1ea3. T\u1eeb vi\u1ec7c thi\u1ebft l\u1eadp gian h\u00e0ng, qu\u1ea3n l\u00fd s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m, ch\u1ea1y qu\u1ea3ng c\u00e1o \u0111\u1ebfn ch\u0103m s\u00f3c kh\u00e1ch h\u00e0ng \u2013 t\u1ea5t c\u1ea3 \u0111\u1ec1u \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c \u0111\u1ed9i ng\u0169 c\u00f3 kinh nghi\u1ec7m th\u1ef1c chi\u1ebfn h\u1ed7 tr\u1ee3 chi ti\u1ebft t\u1eebng b\u01b0\u1edbc. D\u1ecbch v\u1ee5 n\u00e0y \u0111\u1eb7c bi\u1ec7t ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p v\u1edbi nh\u1eefng shop thi\u1ebfu th\u1eddi gian, nh\u00e2n l\u1ef1c ho\u1eb7c ch\u01b0a am hi\u1ec3u c\u00e1ch v\u1eadn h\u00e0nh gian h\u00e0ng hi\u1ec7u qu\u1ea3 tr\u00ean Shopee. C\u00f9ng <a href=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/\"><strong>Lemon Digital<\/strong><\/a> t\u00ecm hi\u1ec3u ngay b\u00e0i vi\u1ebft ngay b\u00ean d\u01b0\u1edbi!<\/div>\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">\u00a0<\/div>\n<h2 class=\"heading-2 ace-line old-record-id-EGT0dDEqDoa7O9xQKpqlihahgmc\" style=\"text-align: left;\">D\u1ecbch v\u1ee5 v\u1eadn h\u00e0nh Shopee l\u00e0 g\u00ec?<\/h2>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-P7igdOq7ZogemAxnMiTlLYp0ghh\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">D\u1ecbch v\u1ee5 v\u1eadn h\u00e0nh Shopee l\u00e0 g\u00f3i gi\u1ea3i ph\u00e1p h\u1ed7 tr\u1ee3 to\u00e0n di\u1ec7n d\u00e0nh cho c\u00e1c nh\u00e0 b\u00e1n h\u00e0ng tr\u00ean s\u00e0n Shopee, gi\u00fap t\u1ed1i \u01b0u ho\u00e1 qu\u00e1 tr\u00ecnh kinh doanh t\u1eeb A \u0111\u1ebfn Z. Thay v\u00ec t\u1ef1 m\u00ecnh x\u1eed l\u00fd m\u1ecdi vi\u1ec7c, ng\u01b0\u1eddi b\u00e1n c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 thu\u00ea \u0111\u01a1n v\u1ecb chuy\u00ean nghi\u1ec7p th\u1ef1c hi\u1ec7n c\u00e1c c\u00f4ng vi\u1ec7c nh\u01b0:<\/div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-KMGcdRb4rod3XTx4gonlYOR4gpd\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>Qu\u1ea3n l\u00fd gian h\u00e0ng (\u0111\u0103ng s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m, vi\u1ebft m\u00f4 t\u1ea3, t\u1ed1i \u01b0u SEO&#8230;)<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-M7rVdc0fnor98XxyxVfl5UyugPb\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>Ch\u0103m s\u00f3c kh\u00e1ch h\u00e0ng (tr\u1ea3 l\u1eddi tin nh\u1eafn, x\u1eed l\u00fd khi\u1ebfu n\u1ea1i)<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-JDysdQYWDortAKxhSxtljArWgAd\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>X\u1eed l\u00fd \u0111\u01a1n h\u00e0ng (\u0111\u00f3ng g\u00f3i, theo d\u00f5i giao v\u1eadn)<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-LX6Sd3UT1o1idQxlVdulv1yHg0c\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>T\u1ed1i \u01b0u qu\u1ea3ng c\u00e1o Shopee Ads<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-M1WOdYVrUofvRUxB2mIlGolXgcc\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>Ph\u00e2n t\u00edch hi\u1ec7u qu\u1ea3 b\u00e1n h\u00e0ng, \u0111\u1ec1 xu\u1ea5t chi\u1ebfn l\u01b0\u1ee3c t\u0103ng tr\u01b0\u1edfng<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-KWwudcZDGoop5YxhuwxlC1Xqg9f\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">N\u00f3i c\u00e1ch kh\u00e1c, \u0111\u00e2y l\u00e0 d\u1ecbch v\u1ee5 &#8220;v\u1eadn h\u00e0nh thu\u00ea&#8221; tr\u00ean Shopee \u2013 ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p v\u1edbi c\u00e1c shop b\u1eadn r\u1ed9n, thi\u1ebfu nh\u00e2n l\u1ef1c ho\u1eb7c mu\u1ed1n t\u1eadp trung v\u00e0o s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m thay v\u00ec v\u1eadn h\u00e0nh k\u1ef9 thu\u1eadt.<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-LLZPdgf4toclUSxSqZPljI4uggd\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<figure id=\"attachment_4383\" aria-describedby=\"caption-attachment-4383\" style=\"width: 1200px\" class=\"wp-caption aligncenter\"><img fetchpriority=\"high\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"size-full wp-image-4383\" src=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/06\/48.png\" alt=\"D\u1ecbch V\u1ee5 V\u1eadn H\u00e0nh Shopee L\u00e0 G\u00ec?\" width=\"1200\" height=\"628\" srcset=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/06\/48.png 1200w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/06\/48-300x157.png 300w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/06\/48-1024x536.png 1024w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/06\/48-768x402.png 768w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/06\/48-600x314.png 600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1200px) 100vw, 1200px\" \/><figcaption id=\"caption-attachment-4383\" class=\"wp-caption-text\">D\u1ecbch V\u1ee5 V\u1eadn H\u00e0nh Shopee<\/figcaption><\/figure><\/p>\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<h2 class=\"heading-2 ace-line old-record-id-FEmtdt3eGoy2KXxbKAzlQ5Dzg1e\" style=\"text-align: left;\">Quy tr\u00ecnh giao h\u00e0ng c\u1ee7a Shopee<\/h2>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Uvo0dz7X7o0FvyxLDVNlUAoNggf\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>B\u01b0\u1edbc 1: Ng\u01b0\u1eddi mua \u0111\u1eb7t h\u00e0ng<\/strong><\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Uvo0dz7X7o0FvyxLDVNlUAoNggf\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">Kh\u00e1ch h\u00e0ng truy c\u1eadp Shopee, l\u1ef1a ch\u1ecdn s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m, ti\u1ebfn h\u00e0nh \u0111\u1eb7t mua v\u00e0 thanh to\u00e1n theo h\u00ecnh th\u1ee9c mong mu\u1ed1n.<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-GhFvdU9jeorGPExZReglBAk8gqh\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>B\u01b0\u1edbc 2: Ng\u01b0\u1eddi b\u00e1n x\u00e1c nh\u1eadn v\u00e0 chu\u1ea9n b\u1ecb h\u00e0ng<\/strong><\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-GhFvdU9jeorGPExZReglBAk8gqh\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">Sau khi nh\u1eadn \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c th\u00f4ng b\u00e1o t\u1eeb h\u1ec7 th\u1ed1ng, ng\u01b0\u1eddi b\u00e1n x\u00e1c nh\u1eadn \u0111\u01a1n h\u00e0ng, ki\u1ec3m tra s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m, \u0111\u00f3ng g\u00f3i c\u1ea9n th\u1eadn v\u00e0 in phi\u1ebfu v\u1eadn chuy\u1ec3n. Th\u1eddi gian chu\u1ea9n b\u1ecb h\u00e0ng th\u01b0\u1eddng t\u1eeb 1\u20132 ng\u00e0y.<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-EiM2dv6QaozW1TxTQxMlefn1gdf\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>B\u01b0\u1edbc 3: B\u00e0n giao cho \u0111\u01a1n v\u1ecb v\u1eadn chuy\u1ec3n<\/strong><\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-EiM2dv6QaozW1TxTQxMlefn1gdf\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">Ng\u01b0\u1eddi b\u00e1n g\u1eedi h\u00e0ng \u0111\u1ebfn \u0111i\u1ec3m giao nh\u1eadn ho\u1eb7c ch\u1edd \u0111\u01a1n v\u1ecb v\u1eadn chuy\u1ec3n \u0111\u1ebfn l\u1ea5y h\u00e0ng tr\u1ef1c ti\u1ebfp t\u1ea1i shop t\u00f9y theo h\u00ecnh th\u1ee9c \u0111\u00e3 \u0111\u0103ng k\u00fd.<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-DtVqdglOtoLVH4xq33Wldjuxgng\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>B\u01b0\u1edbc 4: V\u1eadn chuy\u1ec3n \u0111\u1ebfn ng\u01b0\u1eddi mua<\/strong><\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-DtVqdglOtoLVH4xq33Wldjuxgng\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">H\u00e0ng h\u00f3a \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c ph\u00e2n lo\u1ea1i t\u1ea1i kho, lu\u00e2n chuy\u1ec3n qua c\u00e1c tr\u1ea1m trung gian, sau \u0111\u00f3 \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c shipper giao t\u1eadn n\u01a1i cho ng\u01b0\u1eddi mua.<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-LVzXdBsJCoN61wxHjIRlBYpsgwc\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>B\u01b0\u1edbc 5: Ng\u01b0\u1eddi mua nh\u1eadn h\u00e0ng v\u00e0 x\u00e1c nh\u1eadn<\/strong><\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-LVzXdBsJCoN61wxHjIRlBYpsgwc\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">Ng\u01b0\u1eddi mua ki\u1ec3m tra s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m khi nh\u1eadn. N\u1ebfu kh\u00f4ng c\u00f3 v\u1ea5n \u0111\u1ec1 g\u00ec, h\u1ecd x\u00e1c nh\u1eadn \u201c\u0110\u00e3 nh\u1eadn h\u00e0ng\u201d tr\u00ean \u1ee9ng d\u1ee5ng Shopee.<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-LtuvdiOpwoyQ3px0M4rlwJpHgFd\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>B\u01b0\u1edbc 6: Ho\u00e0n t\u1ea5t \u0111\u01a1n h\u00e0ng v\u00e0 thanh to\u00e1n cho ng\u01b0\u1eddi b\u00e1n<\/strong><\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-LtuvdiOpwoyQ3px0M4rlwJpHgFd\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">Sau khi ng\u01b0\u1eddi mua nh\u1eadn h\u00e0ng v\u00e0 kh\u00f4ng khi\u1ebfu n\u1ea1i trong v\u00f2ng 24\u201372h, Shopee s\u1ebd chuy\u1ec3n ti\u1ec1n v\u00e0o v\u00ed Shopee c\u1ee7a ng\u01b0\u1eddi b\u00e1n.<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-E3KOdinioou3Fpx687KlhEwpgmg\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\u00a0<\/div>\n<h2 class=\"heading-2 ace-line old-record-id-LGmXdOjF1o5jkfxLAitlEOrXgmh\" style=\"text-align: left;\">D\u1ecbch v\u1ee5 v\u1eadn h\u00e0nh gian h\u00e0ng t\u1ea1i Lemon c\u00f3 g\u00ec?<\/h2>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-FbYUdW0xUoasWcxnxO6liXv0gje\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<div data-page-id=\"DfJPdzwOnoX0LYxAMr7lZUydgIp\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-FbYUdW0xUoasWcxnxO6liXv0gje\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<div data-page-id=\"DfJPdzwOnoX0LYxAMr7lZUydgIp\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-FbYUdW0xUoasWcxnxO6liXv0gje\">Trong b\u1ed1i c\u1ea3nh th\u01b0\u01a1ng m\u1ea1i \u0111i\u1ec7n t\u1eed c\u1ea1nh tranh ng\u00e0y c\u00e0ng gay g\u1eaft, vi\u1ec7c duy tr\u00ec m\u1ed9t gian h\u00e0ng ho\u1ea1t \u0111\u1ed9ng hi\u1ec7u qu\u1ea3 kh\u00f4ng ch\u1ec9 \u0111\u01a1n gi\u1ea3n l\u00e0 \u0111\u0103ng s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m v\u00e0 ch\u1edd \u0111\u01a1n. Hi\u1ec3u \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c \u0111i\u1ec1u \u0111\u00f3, <strong>Lemon cung c\u1ea5p d\u1ecbch v\u1ee5 v\u1eadn h\u00e0nh gian h\u00e0ng tr\u1ecdn g\u00f3i<\/strong>, gi\u00fap c\u00e1c ch\u1ee7 shop ti\u1ebft ki\u1ec7m th\u1eddi gian, t\u1ed1i \u01b0u chi ph\u00ed v\u00e0 gia t\u0103ng doanh thu b\u1ec1n v\u1eefng. T\u1ea1i Lemon, ch\u00fang t\u00f4i t\u1eadp trung h\u1ed7 tr\u1ee3 kinh doanh tr\u00ean c\u00e1c n\u1ec1n t\u1ea3ng th\u01b0\u01a1ng m\u1ea1i \u0111i\u1ec7n t\u1eed, \u0111\u1eb7c bi\u1ec7t l\u00e0 <strong>Shopee<\/strong>, v\u1edbi c\u00e1c d\u1ecbch v\u1ee5 ch\u00ednh g\u1ed3m:<\/div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-I4ODdJ1qQoIRYWxYL6flUblMgnb\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>X\u00e2y d\u1ef1ng v\u00e0 t\u1ed1i \u01b0u gian h\u00e0ng:<\/strong> T\u01b0 v\u1ea5n thi\u1ebft k\u1ebf gian h\u00e0ng chu\u1ea9n SEO, c\u1eadp nh\u1eadt th\u00f4ng tin s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m, h\u00ecnh \u1ea3nh, m\u00f4 t\u1ea3 h\u1ea5p d\u1eabn v\u00e0 \u0111\u00fang chu\u1ea9n s\u00e0n.<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-B0lWdCCEWovtVAxyVVLlugfAgXc\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Qu\u1ea3n l\u00fd \u0111\u01a1n h\u00e0ng v\u00e0 ch\u0103m s\u00f3c kh\u00e1ch h\u00e0ng:<\/strong> \u0110\u1ea3m b\u1ea3o quy tr\u00ecnh x\u1eed l\u00fd \u0111\u01a1n m\u01b0\u1ee3t m\u00e0, tr\u1ea3 l\u1eddi tin nh\u1eafn nhanh ch\u00f3ng, t\u0103ng t\u1ef7 l\u1ec7 ch\u1ed1t \u0111\u01a1n. H\u1ed7 tr\u1ee3 t\u01b0 v\u1ea5n mi\u1ec5n ph\u00ed (v\u00ed d\u1ee5: 30 ph\u00fat qua Zoom) \u0111\u1ec3 gi\u1ea3i quy\u1ebft c\u00e1c v\u1ea5n \u0111\u1ec1 kinh doanh.<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-BbgVdklgZoMrfjxNxHblm6U6gbe\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>L\u00ean k\u1ebf ho\u1ea1ch n\u1ed9i dung v\u00e0 t\u1ed5 ch\u1ee9c livestream:<\/strong> T\u1ea1o l\u1ecbch b\u00e0i vi\u1ebft, thi\u1ebft k\u1ebf banner, video, \u0111\u1ed3ng th\u1eddi t\u1ed5 ch\u1ee9c livestream chuy\u00ean nghi\u1ec7p nh\u1eb1m t\u0103ng t\u01b0\u01a1ng t\u00e1c v\u00e0 \u0111\u01a1n h\u00e0ng.<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-J9m0dsTWvo7O9TxpVhVlUSGAgQe\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Ch\u1ea1y qu\u1ea3ng c\u00e1o v\u00e0 t\u1ed1i \u01b0u ng\u00e2n s\u00e1ch:<\/strong> Qu\u1ea3n l\u00fd chi\u1ebfn d\u1ecbch Shopee Ads, TikTok Ads&#8230;, ph\u00e2n t\u00edch hi\u1ec7u su\u1ea5t v\u00e0 li\u00ean t\u1ee5c t\u1ed1i \u01b0u ROI.<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-ZyHtdloOAobXhyxfD8Kln0nOgJf\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>B\u00e1o c\u00e1o \u2013 Ph\u00e2n t\u00edch \u2013 \u0110\u1ec1 xu\u1ea5t c\u1ea3i ti\u1ebfn:<\/strong> C\u1eadp nh\u1eadt \u0111\u1ecbnh k\u1ef3 hi\u1ec7u qu\u1ea3 ho\u1ea1t \u0111\u1ed9ng, \u0111\u1ec1 xu\u1ea5t c\u1ea3i ti\u1ebfn s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m ho\u1eb7c m\u1edf r\u1ed9ng sang c\u00e1c s\u00e0n TM\u0110T kh\u00e1c.<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-NpdZdQQKFonDxdxuNUxlJYP7ghr\">D\u00f9 b\u1ea1n l\u00e0 shop m\u1edbi hay \u0111\u00e3 kinh doanh l\u00e2u n\u0103m, Lemon \u0111\u1ec1u c\u00f3 g\u00f3i d\u1ecbch v\u1ee5 ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p \u0111\u1ec3 \u0111\u1ed3ng h\u00e0nh c\u00f9ng b\u1ea1n ph\u00e1t tri\u1ec3n b\u1ec1n v\u1eefng tr\u00ean Shopee. N\u1ebfu c\u1ea7n demo ho\u1eb7c t\u01b0 v\u1ea5n c\u1ee5 th\u1ec3, \u0111\u1eebng ng\u1ea1i li\u00ean h\u1ec7 ngay v\u1edbi \u0111\u1ed9i ng\u0169 c\u1ee7a ch\u00fang t\u00f4i.<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<h3 class=\"heading-3 ace-line old-record-id-SgQ9dJ5rIoaal3xqnWolrZLYg8b\" style=\"text-align: left;\"><strong>\u0110\u1eb7c \u0111i\u1ec3m n\u1ed5i b\u1eadt c\u1ee7a LEMON DIGITAL:<\/strong><\/h3>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-RJZ3dbRFGojJXmxzR4YlptLJgAh\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">&#8211; Lemon Digital l\u00e0 \u0111\u1ed1i t\u00e1c h\u00e0ng \u0111\u1ea7u c\u1ee7a TikTok Shop, Shopee, Lazada, Haravan, v\u1edbi h\u01a1n 300 th\u01b0\u01a1ng hi\u1ec7u \u0111\u1ed3ng h\u00e0nh trong g\u1ea7n 5 n\u0103m.<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-GeLKdtX7GoBusjxguJRlcYHpgig\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">&#8211; \u0110\u1ed9i ng\u0169 gi\u00e0u kinh nghi\u1ec7m, t\u1eadp trung v\u00e0o t\u0103ng tr\u01b0\u1edfng doanh s\u1ed1 v\u00e0 t\u1ed1i \u01b0u chi ph\u00ed cho kh\u00e1ch h\u00e0ng.<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Qr6MdOj41oNx1yxPMABlQVTBgWg\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">&#8211; \u0110\u00e3 t\u1ed5 ch\u1ee9c c\u00e1c s\u1ef1 ki\u1ec7n l\u1edbn nh\u01b0 <strong>Lemon Day<\/strong> tr\u00ean TikTok Shop, gi\u00fap t\u0103ng \u0111\u01a1n h\u00e0ng l\u00ean 300% so v\u1edbi ng\u00e0y th\u01b0\u1eddng.<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-K7MGddbwloX3whxz8ClleIn6gXg\" style=\"text-align: left;\"><em>\u0110\u1ec3 bi\u1ebft th\u00eam chi ti\u1ebft ho\u1eb7c b\u00e1o gi\u00e1 c\u1ee5 th\u1ec3, b\u1ea1n c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 li\u00ean h\u1ec7 tr\u1ef1c ti\u1ebfp qua website <a href=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/\">lemondigital.vn<\/a> ho\u1eb7c \u0111\u0103ng k\u00fd t\u01b0 v\u1ea5n mi\u1ec5n ph\u00ed t\u1ea1i <a href=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.store\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">https:\/\/lemondigital.store\/<\/a><\/em><\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<h2 class=\"heading-2 ace-line old-record-id-Tk3SdKK35ouv1vxYezolLX6sgTf\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">Quy tr\u00ecnh l\u00e0m vi\u1ec7c t\u1ea1i Lemon Digital<\/h2>\n<\/div>\n<div data-page-id=\"DfJPdzwOnoX0LYxAMr7lZUydgIp\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-JQRQd9qRcoeAopxQJR8laQuHg1r\">\u0110\u00e2y l\u00e0 quy tr\u00ecnh t\u1ea1i Lemon Digital \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c thi\u1ebft k\u1ebf linh ho\u1ea1t theo t\u1eebng ng\u00e0nh h\u00e0ng v\u00e0 m\u1ee5c ti\u00eau c\u1ee5 th\u1ec3 (t\u0103ng tr\u01b0\u1edfng \u0111\u01a1n, t\u1ed1i \u01b0u chi ph\u00ed Ads, x\u00e2y th\u01b0\u01a1ng hi\u1ec7u l\u00e2u d\u00e0i,&#8230;)<\/div>\n<div>\n<figure id=\"attachment_4386\" aria-describedby=\"caption-attachment-4386\" style=\"width: 1200px\" class=\"wp-caption aligncenter\"><img decoding=\"async\" class=\"size-full wp-image-4386\" src=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/06\/53.png\" alt=\"Quy tr\u00ecnh l\u00e0m vi\u1ec7c t\u1ea1i Lemon Digital\" width=\"1200\" height=\"628\" srcset=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/06\/53.png 1200w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/06\/53-300x157.png 300w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/06\/53-1024x536.png 1024w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/06\/53-768x402.png 768w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/06\/53-600x314.png 600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1200px) 100vw, 1200px\" \/><figcaption id=\"caption-attachment-4386\" class=\"wp-caption-text\">Quy tr\u00ecnh l\u00e0m vi\u1ec7c t\u1ea1i Lemon Digital<\/figcaption><\/figure><\/p>\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-PIl4dgHvGoTTgCxpoIslWrEnglc\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>B\u01b0\u1edbc 1:T\u01b0 v\u1ea5n v\u00e0 ph\u00e2n t\u00edch nhu c\u1ea7u<\/strong>:<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-DAkZdrenSoheQBx3PUTlp8ibgIc\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">Lemon Digital ti\u1ebfp nh\u1eadn th\u00f4ng tin t\u1eeb kh\u00e1ch h\u00e0ng qua \u0111\u0103ng k\u00fd t\u01b0 v\u1ea5n (mi\u1ec5n ph\u00ed, th\u01b0\u1eddng l\u00e0 30 ph\u00fat qua Zoom). \u0110\u1ed3ng th\u1eddi ph\u00e2n t\u00edch t\u00ecnh tr\u1ea1ng kinh doanh hi\u1ec7n t\u1ea1i, s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m, \u0111\u1ed1i th\u1ee7 c\u1ea1nh tranh v\u00e0 m\u1ee5c ti\u00eau c\u1ee7a kh\u00e1ch h\u00e0ng. \u0110\u1ec1 xu\u1ea5t chi\u1ebfn l\u01b0\u1ee3c kinh doanh \u0111a s\u00e0n ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p, bao g\u1ed3m k\u1ebf ho\u1ea1ch t\u1ed1i \u01b0u gian h\u00e0ng v\u00e0 qu\u1ea3ng c\u00e1o.<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-RLbJdXCbDoGCnyxoetQlws4DgJf\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>B\u01b0\u1edbc 2: Thi\u1ebft l\u1eadp v\u00e0 t\u1ed1i \u01b0u gian h\u00e0ng: <\/strong><\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-BLXBdnURBoIhgex2WUwlWINYgBe\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">Kh\u1edfi t\u1ea1o ho\u1eb7c n\u00e2ng c\u1ea5p gian h\u00e0ng tr\u00ean c\u00e1c s\u00e0n th\u01b0\u01a1ng m\u1ea1i \u0111i\u1ec7n t\u1eed, \u0111\u1ea3m b\u1ea3o \u0111\u1ea1t chu\u1ea9n (v\u00ed d\u1ee5: chu\u1ea9n Mall n\u1ebfu c\u1ea7n). T\u1ed1i \u01b0u n\u1ed9i dung s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m: ch\u1ee5p \u1ea3nh, ch\u1ec9nh s\u1eeda h\u00ecnh \u1ea3nh, vi\u1ebft m\u00f4 t\u1ea3, nghi\u00ean c\u1ee9u t\u1eeb kh\u00f3a SEO \u0111\u1ec3 t\u0103ng th\u1ee9 h\u1ea1ng t\u00ecm ki\u1ebfm. C\u1ea5u h\u00ecnh c\u00e1c c\u00f4ng c\u1ee5 qu\u1ea3n l\u00fd gian h\u00e0ng v\u00e0 t\u00edch h\u1ee3p v\u1edbi h\u1ec7 th\u1ed1ng nh\u01b0 Haravan (n\u1ebfu c\u00f3).<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Akihd7AdOoj0z8xUsdNl6elAgBg\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>B\u01b0\u1edbc 3: X\u00e2y d\u1ef1ng k\u1ebf ho\u1ea1ch v\u1eadn h\u00e0nh<\/strong>:<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Y53mdszhOoOfRExCJCDlwGP1gxh\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\u1ede b\u01b0\u1edbc n\u00e0y, doanh nghi\u1ec7p c\u1ea7n l\u1eadp chi\u1ebfn l\u01b0\u1ee3c qu\u1ea3ng c\u00e1o v\u00e0 marketing \u0111a k\u00eanh, bao g\u1ed3m Shopee Ads, TikTok Ads, Facebook v\u00e0 Instagram \u0111\u1ec3 ti\u1ebfp c\u1eadn \u0111\u00fang \u0111\u1ed1i t\u01b0\u1ee3ng m\u1ee5c ti\u00eau. \u0110\u1ed3ng th\u1eddi, l\u00ean k\u1ebf ho\u1ea1ch n\u1ed9i dung chi ti\u1ebft nh\u01b0 b\u00e0i vi\u1ebft, video ng\u1eafn, h\u00ecnh \u1ea3nh v\u00e0 c\u00e1c bu\u1ed5i livestream nh\u1eb1m t\u0103ng t\u01b0\u01a1ng t\u00e1c v\u00e0 n\u00e2ng cao m\u1ee9c \u0111\u1ed9 nh\u1eadn di\u1ec7n th\u01b0\u01a1ng hi\u1ec7u. Vi\u1ec7c ph\u00e2n b\u1ed5 ng\u00e2n s\u00e1ch qu\u1ea3ng c\u00e1o c\u1ea7n \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c t\u00ednh to\u00e1n h\u1ee3p l\u00fd cho t\u1eebng k\u00eanh, k\u1ebft h\u1ee3p theo d\u00f5i v\u00e0 t\u1ed1i \u01b0u t\u1ef7 l\u1ec7 ho\u00e0n v\u1ed1n (ROI) \u0111\u1ec3 \u0111\u1ea3m b\u1ea3o hi\u1ec7u qu\u1ea3 cao nh\u1ea5t cho m\u1ed7i chi\u1ebfn d\u1ecbch truy\u1ec1n th\u00f4ng.<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-UmgydqimwokjSGxnKoNl1iLPgVh\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>B\u01b0\u1edbc 4: Th\u1ef1c thi v\u00e0 qu\u1ea3n l\u00fd<\/strong>:<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-UBgPdVK8hoO0EnxPTIwlE10agxg\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">Giai \u0111o\u1ea1n n\u00e0y doanh nghi\u1ec7p tri\u1ec3n khai c\u00e1c chi\u1ebfn d\u1ecbch qu\u1ea3ng c\u00e1o \u0111\u00e3 l\u00ean k\u1ebf ho\u1ea1ch, \u0111\u1ed3ng th\u1eddi qu\u1ea3n l\u00fd gian h\u00e0ng m\u1ed7i ng\u00e0y b\u1eb1ng c\u00e1ch c\u1eadp nh\u1eadt s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m, x\u1eed l\u00fd \u0111\u01a1n h\u00e0ng v\u00e0 ch\u0103m s\u00f3c kh\u00e1ch h\u00e0ng k\u1ecbp th\u1eddi. N\u1ebfu c\u00f3 t\u1ed5 ch\u1ee9c livestream b\u00e1n h\u00e0ng, c\u1ea7n s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng studio chuy\u00ean nghi\u1ec7p c\u00f9ng \u0111\u1ed9i ng\u0169 host c\u1ee7a Lemon \u0111\u1ec3 t\u1ed1i \u01b0u hi\u1ec7u qu\u1ea3. Song song \u0111\u00f3, vi\u1ec7c theo d\u00f5i hi\u1ec7u su\u1ea5t gian h\u00e0ng \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c th\u1ef1c hi\u1ec7n li\u00ean t\u1ee5c th\u00f4ng qua c\u00e1c ch\u1ec9 s\u1ed1 quan tr\u1ecdng nh\u01b0 l\u01b0\u1ee3t xem, t\u1ef7 l\u1ec7 chuy\u1ec3n \u0111\u1ed5i v\u00e0 doanh thu, nh\u1eb1m \u0111\u00e1nh gi\u00e1 hi\u1ec7u qu\u1ea3 ho\u1ea1t \u0111\u1ed9ng v\u00e0 k\u1ecbp th\u1eddi \u0111i\u1ec1u ch\u1ec9nh chi\u1ebfn l\u01b0\u1ee3c khi c\u1ea7n thi\u1ebft.<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-NfgVd9bv9o7xeGx2As6lenmxgGb\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>B\u01b0\u1edbc 5: B\u00e1o c\u00e1o v\u00e0 t\u1ed1i \u01b0u<\/strong>:<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-LC3sdPJO1odv34xOEadlYjpSgvh\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">Doanh nghi\u1ec7p c\u1ea7n cung c\u1ea5p b\u00e1o c\u00e1o \u0111\u1ecbnh k\u1ef3 theo tu\u1ea7n ho\u1eb7c th\u00e1ng \u0111\u1ec3 \u0111\u00e1nh gi\u00e1 hi\u1ec7u qu\u1ea3 kinh doanh, hi\u1ec7u su\u1ea5t qu\u1ea3ng c\u00e1o v\u00e0 c\u00e1c ch\u1ec9 s\u1ed1 quan tr\u1ecdng nh\u01b0 l\u01b0\u1ee3t ti\u1ebfp c\u1eadn, t\u1ef7 l\u1ec7 chuy\u1ec3n \u0111\u1ed5i v\u00e0 doanh thu. D\u1ef1a tr\u00ean d\u1eef li\u1ec7u thu th\u1eadp \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c, \u0111\u1ed9i ng\u0169 ph\u00e2n t\u00edch s\u1ebd ti\u1ebfn h\u00e0nh \u0111\u00e1nh gi\u00e1, \u0111i\u1ec1u ch\u1ec9nh chi\u1ebfn l\u01b0\u1ee3c ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p nh\u1eb1m t\u1ed1i \u01b0u chi ph\u00ed v\u00e0 th\u00fac \u0111\u1ea9y t\u0103ng tr\u01b0\u1edfng doanh s\u1ed1. Ngo\u00e0i ra, n\u1ebfu ti\u1ec1m n\u0103ng th\u1ecb tr\u01b0\u1eddng cho ph\u00e9p, c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 \u0111\u1ec1 xu\u1ea5t c\u1ea3i ti\u1ebfn quy tr\u00ecnh ho\u1eb7c m\u1edf r\u1ed9ng ho\u1ea1t \u0111\u1ed9ng kinh doanh sang c\u00e1c s\u00e0n th\u01b0\u01a1ng m\u1ea1i \u0111i\u1ec7n t\u1eed kh\u00e1c \u0111\u1ec3 \u0111a d\u1ea1ng h\u00f3a k\u00eanh b\u00e1n h\u00e0ng v\u00e0 t\u0103ng c\u01a1 h\u1ed9i ti\u1ebfp c\u1eadn kh\u00e1ch h\u00e0ng.<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-EHGDd83qvoccHWxDP8YlduNxgEe\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>B\u01b0\u1edbc 6: \u0110\u00e0o t\u1ea1o v\u00e0 b\u00e0n giao (t\u00f9y g\u00f3i d\u1ecbch v\u1ee5)<\/strong>:<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-KlGMdDlSIo8WpTxtm7WlnzWqgkc\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\u00c1p d\u1ee5ng t\u00f9y theo g\u00f3i d\u1ecbch v\u1ee5), nh\u1eb1m \u0111\u1ea3m b\u1ea3o kh\u00e1ch h\u00e0ng c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 ti\u1ebfp t\u1ee5c v\u1eadn h\u00e0nh hi\u1ec7u qu\u1ea3 sau khi k\u1ebft th\u00fac h\u1ee3p t\u00e1c. Trong b\u01b0\u1edbc n\u00e0y, Lemon Digital s\u1ebd t\u1ed5 ch\u1ee9c \u0111\u00e0o t\u1ea1o cho \u0111\u1ed9i ng\u0169 c\u1ee7a kh\u00e1ch h\u00e0ng v\u1ec1 c\u00e1ch qu\u1ea3n l\u00fd gian h\u00e0ng, v\u1eadn h\u00e0nh \u0111\u01a1n h\u00e0ng v\u00e0 tri\u1ec3n khai qu\u1ea3ng c\u00e1o tr\u00ean c\u00e1c n\u1ec1n t\u1ea3ng nh\u01b0 Shopee, TikTok ho\u1eb7c Facebook. \u0110\u1ed3ng th\u1eddi, n\u1ebfu kh\u00e1ch h\u00e0ng c\u00f3 nhu c\u1ea7u t\u1ef1 qu\u1ea3n l\u00fd sau d\u1ef1 \u00e1n, \u0111\u1ed9i ng\u0169 s\u1ebd h\u1ed7 tr\u1ee3 b\u00e0n giao to\u00e0n b\u1ed9 quy tr\u00ecnh, t\u00e0i li\u1ec7u h\u01b0\u1edbng d\u1eabn v\u00e0 c\u00e1c c\u00f4ng c\u1ee5 c\u1ea7n thi\u1ebft \u0111\u1ec3 \u0111\u1ea3m b\u1ea3o vi\u1ec7c v\u1eadn h\u00e0nh di\u1ec5n ra su\u00f4n s\u1ebb v\u00e0 \u0111\u1ed9c l\u1eadp.<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-EU5CdmNowoAPcJx5xUjlyY8tgrf\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>L\u01b0u \u00fd<\/strong>:<\/div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VFUEdCK8hoT79gxKnOUlHw03gRg\" style=\"text-align: justify;\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>Quy tr\u00ecnh c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c \u0111i\u1ec1u ch\u1ec9nh t\u00f9y theo nhu c\u1ea7u c\u1ee5 th\u1ec3 c\u1ee7a kh\u00e1ch h\u00e0ng v\u00e0 g\u00f3i d\u1ecbch v\u1ee5 (c\u01a1 b\u1ea3n, n\u00e2ng cao, ho\u1eb7c to\u00e0n di\u1ec7n).<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-B73PdPlQro6LcGxZI4flg7mWgJe\" style=\"text-align: justify;\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>Lemon Digital cam k\u1ebft \u0111\u1ed3ng h\u00e0nh l\u00e2u d\u00e0i, v\u1edbi \u0111\u1ed9i ng\u0169 chuy\u00ean m\u00f4n cao v\u00e0 kinh nghi\u1ec7m l\u00e0m vi\u1ec7c v\u1edbi h\u01a1n 300 th\u01b0\u01a1ng hi\u1ec7u.<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-ZLKodLx46od9BaxhYzalJOubgId\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">\u0110\u1ec3 bi\u1ebft chi ti\u1ebft h\u01a1n v\u1ec1 quy tr\u00ecnh ho\u1eb7c b\u00e1o gi\u00e1, b\u1ea1n c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 li\u00ean h\u1ec7 qua <strong>lemondigital.vn<\/strong> ho\u1eb7c \u0111\u0103ng k\u00fd t\u01b0 v\u1ea5n mi\u1ec5n ph\u00ed.<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<\/div>\n<div data-page-id=\"DfJPdzwOnoX0LYxAMr7lZUydgIp\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-PaW8doPiIo56L3xl8lqlQSZDgUb\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\u00a0<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-ZzYcdv9ZBoZl5bx7KWMlynxPgSc\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>C\u00d4NG TY C\u1ed4 PH\u1ea6N LEMON DIGITAL<\/strong><\/div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-FLFEdYvdeocaZPx73RElcqvIgtb\" style=\"text-align: justify;\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>\u0110\u1ecba ch\u1ec9:\u00a0<\/strong> 202 Phan V\u0103n H\u00e2n, Ph\u01b0\u1eddng Gia \u0110\u1ecbnh, H\u1ed3 Ch\u00ed Minh, Vi\u1ec7t Nam<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-IEePdsthtovkgMxYPkSlxYmjgte\" style=\"text-align: justify;\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>\u0110i\u1ec7n tho\u1ea1i: <\/strong>0938785735<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-IRDcdJLMDo3Hjxxs2HLluZSLgYe\" style=\"text-align: justify;\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Email: <\/strong><a href=\"mailto:hi@lemondigital.vn\">hi@lemondigital.vn<\/a><\/div>\n<\/li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-RU8td5mB9ozyUSx4YcElkyTOgrf\" style=\"text-align: justify;\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Website: <\/strong><a href=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/\">https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/<\/a><\/div>\n<\/li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-RsW2dBwzBolCP4xcL1llLjjzgNg\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>Facebook:<\/strong> <a href=\"https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/lemondigital.vn\">Lemon Digital<\/a><\/div>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<\/div>\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>D\u1ecbch v\u1ee5 v\u1eadn h\u00e0nh Shopee l\u00e0 gi\u1ea3i ph\u00e1p tr\u1ecdn g\u00f3i gi\u00fap c\u00e1c nh\u00e0 b\u00e1n h\u00e0ng t\u1ed1i \u01b0u h\u00f3a ho\u1ea1t \u0111\u1ed9ng kinh doanh tr\u00ean s\u00e0n th\u01b0\u01a1ng m\u1ea1i \u0111i\u1ec7n t\u1eed m\u1ed9t c\u00e1ch chuy\u00ean nghi\u1ec7p v\u00e0 hi\u1ec7u qu\u1ea3. T\u1eeb vi\u1ec7c thi\u1ebft l\u1eadp gian h\u00e0ng, qu\u1ea3n l\u00fd s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m, ch\u1ea1y qu\u1ea3ng c\u00e1o \u0111\u1ebfn ch\u0103m s\u00f3c kh\u00e1ch h\u00e0ng \u2013 t\u1ea5t [&hellip;]<\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":5,"featured_media":4763,"comment_status":"open","ping_status":"open","sticky":false,"template":"","format":"standard","meta":{"footnotes":""},"categories":[1,30],"tags":[],"class_list":["post-4379","post","type-post","status-publish","format-standard","has-post-thumbnail","hentry","category-tin-tuc","category-kien-thuc-shopee"],"_links":{"self":[{"href":"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts\/4379","targetHints":{"allow":["GET"]}}],"collection":[{"href":"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts"}],"about":[{"href":"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/types\/post"}],"author":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/users\/5"}],"replies":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/comments?post=4379"}],"version-history":[{"count":8,"href":"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts\/4379\/revisions"}],"predecessor-version":[{"id":5159,"href":"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts\/4379\/revisions\/5159"}],"wp:featuredmedia":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/media\/4763"}],"wp:attachment":[{"href":"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/media?parent=4379"}],"wp:term":[{"taxonomy":"category","embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-jso